<h1
  style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.3; color: #241f18;"
>
  Let's get you back in
</h1>

<p
  style="margin: 0 0 28px 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4b463d;"
>
  Hi {{name}} — someone asked to reset the password for
  this account. If that was you, pick a new one here.
</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
  <tr>
    <td
      style="background-color: #c1683c; border-radius: 999px;"
    >
      <a
        href="{{resetUrl}}"
        style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 28px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;"
        >Choose a new password</a
      >
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p
  style="margin: 28px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #9c9284;"
>
  This link expires in {{expiresIn}} and can be used once.
  If the button doesn't work:<br />
  <a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="color: #c1683c;"
    >{{resetUrl}}</a
  >
</p>

<table
  role="presentation"
  width="100%"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  style="margin: 24px 0 0 0;"
>
  <tr>
    <td
      style="background-color: #fbe1d0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #7a3b22;"
    >
      Didn't ask for this? Nothing has changed yet — you
      can safely ignore this email. Your pets' pages are
      unaffected.
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p
  style="margin: 28px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #9c9284;"
>
  Requested from {{requestContext}}<br />
  Pawtato · Dhanmondi, Dhaka ·
  <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #9c9284;"
    >{{supportEmail}}</a
  >
</p>
